// Bower: a collector reported that the destination refused its identity
// (destination-azure-credential-failed, HTTP 401 or 403) and nothing was delivered since.
// Records are queued behind the failure, so this rule fires when delivery recovers and the
// records arrive: it attributes an outage that collector-health-missing reported as a credential
// or role problem rather than a network one. Live detection is the host check
// (destination-credential) and collector log event 1008.
BowerSecurity_CL
| where EventType == "collector_health"
| where Attributes.problems has "destination-credential"
| summarize FirstRecord = min(TimeGenerated), LastRecord = max(TimeGenerated), Records = count(),
    LastFailureCode = take_any(tostring(Attributes.delivery.lastFailureCode)) by CollectorId
